#: scripts/scenario_06_early_evaluation_exercise.lua:5447
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "We'll protect them as soon as we can"
msgstr "Nous les assisteront dès que nous le pourrons"

#: scripts/scenario_06_early_evaluation_exercise.lua:5452
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "I'm sure they'll appreciate any protection you can provide."
msgstr ""
"Je suis sûr qu'ils apprécieront toute aide que vous pourrez leur offrir."

#: scripts/scenario_06_early_evaluation_exercise.lua:5460
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "We've got their parts and are en route"
msgstr "Nous avons leurs pièces et sommes en route"

#: scripts/scenario_06_early_evaluation_exercise.lua:5465
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid ""
"We will pass along that information. Good luck and keep a sharp eye out for "
"those Kraylor"
msgstr ""
"Nous transmettrons l'information. Bonne chance et gardez un œil attentif sur "
"ces Kraylors."

#: scripts/scenario_06_early_evaluation_exercise.lua:5473
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What about their repair parts?"
msgstr "Qu'en est-il de leurs pièces de rechange ?"

#: scripts/scenario_06_early_evaluation_exercise.lua:5478
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid ""
"You must prioritize and choose your next destination. If they get destroyed, "
"there won't be any engine to repair. Also, their destruction could adversely "
"impact our ongoing diplomatic negotiations with the Arlenians"
msgstr ""
